note.p:
Source: National Archives and Records Administration, RG 59, Records of the
                    Department of State, Central Files, 1964–66, AV 3 ICAO. Limited Official Use;
                    Immediate. Passed to the White House and FAA.

The Department agreed with this approach, and cautioned the delegation to “avoid
                    any situation that would produce walkout.” (Telegram 1337 to Rome, November 27;
                    ibid.)
